<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Contact Us - PMP Mastery</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; background: #f4f7f6; padding: 40px;">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; background: white; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
        
        <nav style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <a href="/" style="margin-right: 20px; color: #0077b6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">🏠 Home</a>
            <a href="/about" style="margin-right: 20px; color: #0077b6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">📖 About</a>
            <a href="/contact" style="color: #0077b6; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-bottom: 2px solid #0077b6;">📬 Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <h1 style="color: #0077b6;">Connect With Us</h1>
        <p style="line-height: 1.6; color: #4a5568;">Have questions about our PMP frameworks or agent workflows? Drop us a line.</p>
        
        <form style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; margin-top: 20px;">
            <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px;" />
            <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px;" />
            <textarea placeholder="Your Message" rows="5" style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 6px;"></textarea>
            <button type="button" style="background: #0077b6; color: white; border: none; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;">Send Message</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>